Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_32db52ec-0b88-3bbe-ad9b-8f32f240e174.xml</text>
